      ],
      "plan": "Draft 3 presents a more structured, checklist-like approach to the hypothetical privacy verification. It integrates prompt containment (F1), log analysis (F2), and network traffic examination (also related to F2) as key verification points. It explicitly notes the hypothetical status and the lack of formal audits (F3), framing the discussion around what constitutes a complete verification process."
